  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On behalf of Irish Embssy Manilla -Irish Aid Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the NRFC in transition to renewable energy by installing a 2.2 kW solar photovoltaic (PV) system at its facility in rural Palau. This will address the challenges posed by the rising and unpredictable cost of fuel, along with the instability of Palau&#x2019;s local energy grid, which is affected by aging infrastructures. Through the adoption of solar energy and net metering, the project will provide a reliable, sustainable power supply for critical operations &#x2013;particularly the storage of fresh fish and use of other essential equipment. Additionally, it will also lower energy and maintenance costs, improving operational stability, and increasing the profitability of local fishing operations.</narrative>
  </description>
